window.products.push({"id":886037,"name":"Iron Chef J 8-Inch Cast Iron Skillet with Bamboo Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H81KCJFCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Joyce Chen has teamed up with The Iron Chef, the wildly popular cooking show that sets the stage for world renown chef's to compete in a feverish, well-stocked, well-equipped stadium kitchen, to create a progressive, advanced technology cast iron cookware collection. Iron Chef cookware is produced using a new proprietary casting technology that enables the production of lightweight, thin-walled cast iron cookware. The technology involves a new process, a special alloy and unique tooling to create an iron casting with less porosity and more ductility. As a result, the casting is not as brittle as conventional cast iron ¿this translates into thinner, less heavy cast iron! Iron Chef cookware has captured the key benefits of cast iron cookware: even heat distribution, good temperature control and good heat retention. Iron Chef cookware has two coats of high-fired enamel on the outside and one coat of enamel as well as one coat of Whitford's highly durable, premium Quantanium non-stick coating on the interior. To remind us of Iron Chef'n Asian origins, the generously sized handles are made from burnished bamboo. Iron Chef cookware is a new concept in cooking. It provides all the positives of cast iron while overcoming the weight problem of traditional cast iron cookware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H81KCJFCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYCE CHEN","source_asin":"B000GHJR9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-886037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GHJR9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GHJR9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
