window.products.push({"id":886314,"name":"MtBoi 3 Pieces of Cake Border Fondant Molds Cake Decorating Tools Chocolate, Candy, Gumpaste Moulds, 3D Heart, Puppy Paw, Rainbow, Cloud, Raindrop Sil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aKuPW9pFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p><b>Unique Product Combination: </b>The package contains 1 piece of romantic 3D heart-shaped silicone mold with different heart sizes, featuring heart-link shape and hear-in-heart shape; 1 piece of 3D puppy paw silicone mold; 1 cloud-shape mold highlighting small rainbow, cloud and raindrop shape.</p> <p><b> </b><b>High-quality mold:</b> Being made of food-grade silicone with a smooth surface, they are safe, strong flexible and durable, tear-resistant and reusable. The material is 100% BPA-free, non-toxic, no chemical coatings, no fillers, long-lasting and non-sticky. Suitable temperature from -40 to +230 °C (-40 to 446 °F).<br></p> <p><b>Wide range of uses: </b>The silicone molds can be used to make chocolate, biscuits, candy, mousse, jelly, cake, bread, ice cubes, soap, fondant, cookie dessert. It is very suitable to make food in family dinners, Easter parties, or make gifts in Valentine's Day. You will also find it useful in Birthdays, Weddings, Mother's Day, Father's Day. It will set the right mood in the right occasion.<br></p> <p><b>Enjoy the cooking:</b> The molds are the perfect tool for homemade food. You can add some favorite food to make more it diverse for your family, friends and lovers, or use them to enjoy fun parent-child time and create amazing desserts! The smooth silicone surface makes it easy to clean, and the premium silicone will enable it serve a very long time.</p> <p><b>Maintenance:</b> You may need to clean it after using. In order to prolong the life of the mold, please try not to clean it with cold right after you take it out of the oven. You can mix the hot water with detergent or put it into dishwasher to clean it. Please make sure the mold is dry before use or storage.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aKuPW9pFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MtBoi","source_asin":"B099KP6V39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-886314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KP6V39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KP6V39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
