window.products.push({"id":886682,"name":"Home-X Terra-Cotta Garlic Baker with Interior Glaze, Garlic Cooking Accessory, Terra-Cotta Garlic Container for Baking, Kitchen Appliance and Décor, 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610QfnCS7hS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unless you happen to be a vampire, the smell of freshly roasted garlic can enchant any kitchen. Instead of roasting chopped pieces in an open pan, you can elevate your roasting technique by utilizing the HOME-X Terra-Cotta Garlic Baker. Terra-cotta means “baked earth” in Italian, and that homey, down-to-earth food quality is what you get when you utilize a dish made of one of the oldest cooking materials. Terra-cotta’s porous material allows it to evenly distribute heat during the baking process while still retaining moisture. This helps prevent your garlic from drying out while making it even more fragrant. This dish set comes with 1 tall domed lid in the shape of a garlic clove, which serves as a handle, and 1 dish base. The garlic baker’s interior is glazed to help facilitate a better baking experience and prevent you from having to season the dish before use. To use, place your garlic on the plate, and cover the lid. Place it in a cold oven, and then set the temperature. Handwashing the dish before each use will help make sure there are no lingering liquids or aromas from previous baking that would interrupt the flavor of the food inside. Be sure not to wash the dish using regular dish soap or other materials that could be absorbed in the material. A solution of hot water and either vinegar or baking soda, if needed, works perfectly to cleanse the lid and plate. Make sure not to expose this dish to drastic temperature changes to avoid causing cracks. This item measures 5 1/4\" D x 4 3/4\" H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610QfnCS7hS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B097VGK3H5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-886682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097VGK3H5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097VGK3H5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
