window.products.push({"id":886760,"name":"Peace Symbol Magnet of USA Flag by MEYOTO LLC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zaYysWlEL._AC_.jpg","description":"The idea that led to its birth lies in the notion that as a general rule most people aspire to live in peace, whoever and wherever they are. The purpose is to unite like-minded individuals into a single voice on a global scale by utilizing the well-known graphic peace icon decorated with stylized national flag photographs. Displaying MEYOTO demonstrates the willingness to participate in a community with a common goal, rather than be a look-at-me individual. MEYOTO is a universal symbol that identifies its bearer and pronounces their desire. This commonality has a unifying effect. Displaying ones heritage (colors) in the context of a fundamental concept (mind) signals a look to the larger view, beyond geography or politics. It allows one to say that even though they are from here or there they recognize that belonging to a community beyond their nationality or nations borders is of great value to their life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zaYysWlEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEYOTO Peace Magnet","source_asin":"B002P6CEZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-886760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002P6CEZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002P6CEZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
