window.products.push({"id":886862,"name":"Caleca Bluemoon 2-Piece Serving Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QJ6D3QM7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Indigo blue, sky-blue and apple green Caleca pattern \"Bluemoon\" that creates strong effects of Mediterranean nature and the ocean atmosphere of Sicily in its design. Ideal for that impressive presentation at the table. Amazon.com Shades of cool blue accented with green gives Bluemoon dinnerware from Caleca a fresh and appealing nature. The two serving pieces in this set display the pattern dramatically thanks to their size: a spectacular 16-inch platter, big enough for a roast or a mountain of rice pilaf topped with chicken breasts, and a 10-1/2-by-4-inch bowl, ideal for a tossed green salad or fresh fruit. Each features a denim-blue center encircled by a thin band of white, then a band of spring green festively dotted with darker green, and finally a swath of robin's egg blue radiating with denim-blue leaves. The outside of the bowl is glossy white accented with one blue stripe near the top. Place settings and serving items feature different combinations of the Bluemoon pattern for a mix-and-match sensibility. Made in Italy of chip-resistant ceramic, each Caleca dinnerware piece is hand-painted by skilled artisans with glazes that meet US standards by being free of lead and cadmium. The hand-painting results in visible brush strokes with variations in tone that afford a casual, comfortable look. Chip-resistant and safe for the microwave and dishwasher, Caleca dinnerware celebrates the marriage of traditional craftsmanship and modern design sensibilities. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 16-inch serving platter; 10-1/2-by-4-inch serving bowl. 2 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QJ6D3QM7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caleca","source_asin":"B0008154L6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-886862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0008154L6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0008154L6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
