window.products.push({"id":886948,"name":"Almcmy Rotary Cheese Grater, Handheld Cheese Shredder Grinder with Rubber Suction Base and 5 Stainless Steel Drum Blades, Mandoline Slicer for Vegetab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XfmUyL03L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Humanized Design】-Vegetable chopper has 5 different types of blades: 1 thin slicer blade, 1 grinder blade, 2 chopper blades and 1 wave cutting blade. The vegetable cutter is made of high quality stainless steel, the other parts are made of food grade BPA free plastic and it has a strong adsorption base, the upgraded 5 pairs of replaceable blades let your use the mandolin slicer vegetable shredder greating for cheese, vegetables, crackers, potatoes, garlic, nuts, cucumbers, radishes and more. 【UPGRADING INNOVATION】-The manual rotary cheese grater keeps your hands away from the sharp blades, turn the handle, the built-in blade will rotate 360° to cut food efficiently, and the quick-release function allows you to change the blade as fast, easy to clean, spiral the handle fixation will not fall off easily, we also include a pair of cut-resistant glovesallowing you to use this grater easily and safely. 【SAVE TIME】-With our 5 blade rotary grater, you can shredder or grind the food you need very efficiently with just a light turn of the handle, not only saving you time and effort, but you don't have to look for Other functional graters, just need a quick blade change,ergonomically designed handle, so you won't feel tired, so you have more time to enjoy meal time with your family. 【SPACE SAVING AND EASY CLEAN】-This cheese grater is light and convenient, it takes up only a little space in the kitchen, the stainless steel blade comes with a storage box, it is very easy to maintain, after disassembly it can be washed with cold water and a soft brush, it’s also be put it into the top layer of the dishwasher, which is convenient for you to clean after use. 【100% Satisfaction Guarantee】- We pay great attention to the quality and practicality of our products, we value our customers and want you to have a pleasant shopping experience. If there is any problem with the grater, please feel free to contact us, we will take care and solve the problem until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XfmUyL03L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Almcmy","source_asin":"B0C3CG2L62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-886948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3CG2L62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3CG2L62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
