window.products.push({"id":886991,"name":"Gifts for Mom from Daughter, Meaningful Gifts for Mom, Rustic Farmhouse Style Tealight Candle Holder, for Mom's Birthday，Mother's Day, Christmas, Vale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gGdARlSBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are many similar tea light candle holders on the market, but we have improved it, made it more rustic, more suitable for the modern farmhouse, and even made it more interesting. We first launched this set especially for mom and included thoughtful words and patterns engraved on the wood, so that she might use these not only to decorate but also to be reminded of our love for her. We noticed that the tealight candle holders on the market are usually designed for real tealight candles, and we thought there would probably be people who worried about whether the candles might burn the wood or cause some other safety hazard, so we equipped them with plastic tealight candles instead. The plastic tea lights can provide more than 10 hours of light, while a real tealight candle can only burn for about 4 hours. Not only is this more economical, and the plastic tea light candle will not be blown out by the wind and will not ruin the atmosphere. Our tea light candle measures 5.5 x 5.5cm, whereas the market one is 4.5 x 4.5cm. It’s the perfect size to give as a gift. It is also not too big and can be placed anywhere. Whether it's mom's birthday, Mother's Day, Christmas, or Valentine's Day, it's a great gift for Mom. Don't hesitate, it's worth your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gGdARlSBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THYGIFTREE","source_asin":"B09WDRVMD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-886991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDRVMD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDRVMD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
